  "description": "The original adult human swordsman, athletic slender build, tan bare upper arms, stern bearded face, steel conical helmet with small top spike and chainmail side coif. Sleeveless blue tabard with two pale silver-white diagonal chevrons across the chest and back, blue rectangular hanging front and rear panels, dark waist belt. Silver steel arm bracers and full leg armor with small gold knee caps, pointed steel boots. Holds one long narrow straight silver sword with small gold hilt in his right hand, diagonally across the body in standing poses; opposite hand clenched. Preserve the native sword direction, size, exact grip and motion. No shield, cloak, extra weapon or invented effects. Only blue tabard areas recolor to green and red; white chevrons, skin, chainmail, steel and gold stay unchanged.",
